{"code":"fr-FR","name":"French","native":"Français","badge":"FR","tts":"fr-FR","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Je ne comprends pas.","say":"zhuh nuh kohm-PRAHN pah","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"lit":"I not understand not"},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Je ne sais pas.","say":"zhuh nuh SEH pah","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Un instant, s’il vous plaît.","say":"uhn ans-TAHN, seel voo PLEH","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Vous pouvez répéter ?","say":"voo poo-VAY ray-pay-TAY","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Plus lentement, s’il vous plaît.","say":"plew lahnt-MAHN, seel voo PLEH","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Comment dit-on « … » ?","say":"koh-MAHN dee-TOHN","en":"How do you say “…”?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Bien sûr.","say":"byan SEWR","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Exactement.","say":"eg-zak-tuh-MAHN","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Je pense que oui.","say":"zhuh PAHNS kuh WEE","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"C’est vrai ?","say":"seh VREH","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Pas de souci.","say":"pahd SOO-see","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Super !","say":"sew-PAIR","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Où est {x} ?","say":"oo EH {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"],"tPl":"Où sont {x} ?","sayPl":"oo SOHN {x}"},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Je voudrais {x}.","say":"zhuh voo-DREH {x}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Vous avez {x} ?","say":"voo-za-VAY {x}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x}, s’il vous plaît.","say":"{x}, seel voo PLEH","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Je dois {x}.","say":"zhuh DWAH {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Je peux {x} ?","say":"zhuh PUH {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Je vais vérifier.","say":"zhuh veh vay-ree-FYAY","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"J’ai une réunion.","say":"zhay ewn ray-ew-NYOHN","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"C’est épicé ?","say":"seh tay-pee-SAY","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Sans oignon, s’il vous plaît.","say":"sahn zoh-NYOHN, seel voo PLEH","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Qu’est-ce que vous me conseillez ?","say":"KES-kuh voo muh kohn-say-YAY","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Je ne mange pas de viande.","say":"zhuh nuh MAHNZH pah duh VYAHND","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"C’est combien ?","say":"seh kohm-BYAN","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Je regarde, merci.","say":"zhuh ruh-GARD, mair-SEE","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Je le prends.","say":"zhuh luh PRAHN","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Je peux payer par carte ?","say":"zhuh puh pay-YAY par KART","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"C’est loin ?","say":"seh LWAN","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"À l’aéroport, s’il vous plaît.","say":"ah lah-ay-roh-POR, seel voo PLEH","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"à gauche · à droite · tout droit","say":"ah GOHSH · ah DRWAHT · too DRWAH","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Au secours !","say":"oh suh-KOOR","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Il n’y a pas de papier toilette.","say":"eel nyah pah duh pah-PYAY twah-LET","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Je me sens mal.","say":"zhuh muh sahn MAL","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Appelez une ambulance, s’il vous plaît.","say":"ah-PLAY ewn ahm-bew-LAHNS","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Enchanté.","say":"ahn-shahn-TAY","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Vous venez d’où ?","say":"voo vuh-NAY DOO","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Qu’est-ce que vous faites dans la vie ?","say":"KES-kuh voo FET dahn lah VEE","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"C’est délicieux !","say":"seh day-lee-SYUH","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Salut.","say":"sah-LEW","en":"Hi. (casual)","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Bonjour.","say":"bohn-ZHOOR","en":"Hello. / Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Comment ça va ?","say":"koh-mahn sah VAH","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Oui. · Non.","say":"wee · nohn","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"S’il vous plaît.","say":"seel voo PLEH","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Merci.","say":"mair-SEE","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Pardon.","say":"par-DOHN","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Au revoir.","say":"oh ruh-VWAHR","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"un · deux · trois","say":"uhn · duh · trwah","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"quatre · cinq · six","say":"KAH-truh · sank · sees","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"sept · huit · neuf","say":"set · weet · nuhf","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"dix · vingt · cent","say":"dees · van · sahn","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"La pomme est rouge.","say":"lah POM eh ROOZH","en":"The apple is red.","note":"adjective after the noun · la = feminine"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Je mange la pomme.","say":"zhuh MAHNZH lah POM","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"the subject is required: je = I"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"J’ai mangé la pomme.","say":"zhay mahn-ZHAY lah POM","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past = “I have eaten”: avoir + mangé"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Je veux manger la pomme.","say":"zhuh vuh mahn-ZHAY lah POM","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"helper + infinitive"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Tu manges des pommes ?","say":"tew MAHNZH day POM","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"a rising voice turns it into a question"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"les toilettes","say":"lay twah-LET","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo","pl":true},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"la pharmacie","say":"lah far-mah-SEE","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"l’hôpital","say":"loh-pee-TAL","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"la gare","say":"lah GAR","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"l’aéroport","say":"lah-ay-roh-POR","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"l’hôtel","say":"loh-TEL","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"de l’eau","say":"duh LOH","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"un café","say":"uhn kah-FAY","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"l’addition","say":"lah-dee-SYOHN","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"la carte","say":"lah KART","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"une bière","say":"ewn BYAIR","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"ça","say":"sah","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"un sac","say":"uhn SAK","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"la réunion","say":"lah ray-ew-NYOHN","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"le fichier","say":"luh fee-SHYAY","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"l’écran","say":"lay-KRAHN","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"le message","say":"luh meh-SAHZH","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"demain","say":"duh-MAN","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"y aller","say":"ee ah-LAY","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"entrer","say":"ahn-TRAY","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"payer","say":"pay-YAY","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Allergie · merci de lire","ask":"Est-ce que ce plat contient un de ces ingrédients ?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Merci beaucoup !","note":"Peanut: “arachide” on menus, “cacahuète” in everyday speech.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"J’ai une allergie grave à l’arachide. Je ne peux pas manger d’arachides ni d’huile d’arachide.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"J’ai une allergie grave aux fruits de mer (crevettes, crabe, coquillages).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Je ne peux pas manger de gluten (blé, orge, seigle).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Je ne mange pas de viande, ni de poulet, ni de poisson.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Je ne mange pas de porc.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"TOILETTES · WC","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"DAMES · HOMMES","en":"Women · Men"},{"t":"SORTIE · ENTRÉE","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"POUSSEZ · TIREZ","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"SORTIE DE SECOURS","en":"Emergency exit"}]}